flowchart LR
  Client[Web / Mobile] --> GW[API Gateway]
  GW --> S[M0 Identity & Access]
  S --> DB[(Identity-owned PostgreSQL schema)]
  S --> REDIS[(Redis: rate limits / bounded cache)]
  S --> KMS[Secrets Manager / KMS]
  S --> OUT[(Transactional outbox)]
  OUT --> MQ[(RabbitMQ identity lifecycle events)]
  S --> AUD[Security audit events]
  S -. telemetry .-> OBS[Logs / Metrics / Traces]

